# Rust code generation (opengeode --toRust + asn1scc -Rust) build
# artifacts. The generated sources carry the process name
# (og.rs, og_ri.rs, og_datamodel*.rs, *_cargo.toml, dataview*.rs,
# asn1rust/) and only the hand-written test harnesses (main.rs,
# patch_ri.py) are tracked; cargo's build tree, the compiled
# executables and the asn1scc debug caches are all derived data.
**/Cargo.toml
**/Cargo.lock
*/target/
**/*_cargo.toml
*/*.rs
!*/main.rs
*/asn1rust/
**/asn1rust/
*/obj/
*/src/
*/debug/
*/test_ada
*/check
**/Makefile.og
# sha256-named ASN.1 cache entries written by asn1scc's python backend
debug/[0-9a-f]*


